{
  "id": "im",
  "displayName": "泽元 IM 机器人",
  "kind": "optional",
  "status": "ready",
  "dependsOn": [
    "core"
  ],
  "defaultSelected": true,
  "install": {
    "target": "features/im",
    "mode": "copy"
  },
  "contents": [
    "HOST 半：钉钉群机器人推送（webhook + 可选加签），任务领取/验收/驳回自动通知",
    "配置存 data/im.json（本地），对外只回脱敏 webhook；配置与测试需 P6+",
    "路由：GET/POST /zeyuan/im/config、POST /zeyuan/im/test",
    "未配置时静默跳过，不阻塞任务流程"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "boardApi": 1,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "smoke": "test-im.mjs",
  "events": {
    "emits": [
      "notified",
      "push-failed"
    ],
    "consumes": [
      "zeyuan:tasks:task-claimed",
      "zeyuan:tasks:task-accepted",
      "zeyuan:tasks:task-rejected"
    ]
  }
}
